    "body": "> So maybe \"This img element undergoes any relevant mutations\"?\r\n\r\nI think this makes sense, although it's a bit ambiguous in terms of what qualifies as a relevant mutation. Meanwhile I can put together more wpt tests to capture cases that we should be handling (and are likely not)\r\n\r\nI think you've mentioned this already but we should probably update the other section that says we reject the decode if src/srcset is not set to capture picture/source use case as well.",
