    "updated_at": "2017-08-16T12:59:10Z",
    "body": "So the algorithm that runs when the window size changes is https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#reacting-to-environment-changes\r\n\r\nTests for relevant mutations:\r\nhttp://w3c-test.org/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-img-element/relevant-mutations.html\r\n\r\nTests for environment changes:\r\nhttp://w3c-test.org/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-img-element/environment-changes/viewport-change.html",
